v class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our restaurant specialises in both Japanese and Sri Lankan cuisine. It is a fusion of flavours from our life. The array of enchanting spices from the roots of Sri Lanka intertwined with the delicate art of Japanese cuisine, all available on our menu. From me and my wife\u2019s time in Japan and our mother country\u2019s cuisine. My brother-in-law and I began our journey of opening this restaurant during the pandemic, facing lots of hardships and delays due to restrictions. Of course now I can see that I do not regret the journey we have taken as a family to be able to create a community here at The Lion, where we offer exceptional customer service and even better food. Now, when I see what this restaurant has become, I see a place where people can come together and create memories and the idea that my food can help them do that\u2026 That is what reminds me why this business was started.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-333828dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"333828dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Specialities<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6f2af682 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"6f2af682\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-6c96a920\" data-id=\"6c96a920\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wr